usage: slopmop NOUN VERB [selectors] [--params] [output flags] [positional]

nouns:
  file, files          files in the input directory
  trace, traces        script trace of the input directory
  finding, findings    detections aggregated from the trace
  report, reports      summary of an analysis of the input directory
  campaign, campaigns  campaigns named in a threat intelligence watchlist

more help: slopmop NOUN -h, slopmop NOUN VERB -h
